{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts#L83","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts:83"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A "},{"type":"link","href":"StreamDurability.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"StreamDurability"}]},{"type":"text","value":" that can re-persist an already-stored range\nidempotently."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A run driver resuming after a crash re-derives the same offsets from its\nsource position, so replaying an overlapping range must be a no-op rather\nthan producing duplicates. That capability is deliberately a "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"separate,\noptional method"}]},{"type":"text","value":" instead of an optional parameter on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"append"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only adapters that actually support it return this type, so a consumer\nrequiring the capability asks for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UpsertableStreamDurability"},{"type":"text","value":" and a\nmismatch is a compile error rather than a runtime failure buried in a\nrun log."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pairing each chunk with its offset structurally makes a length mismatch\nand an unpaired chunk unrepresentable. A sparse hole is still\nrepresentable, so implementations must reject one explicitly."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementations MUST validate the entire batch before mutating any stored\nstate (so a rejected call never partially applies), MUST reject an offset\nthey did not mint themselves (every accepted offset is resumable by\ndefinition), MUST reject an offset repeated within one batch, and MUST\nreject a hole in the entries array."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"extends","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"StreamDurability.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StreamDurability"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toffset","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOffset"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOffset"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"append","children":[{"type":"text","value":"append"}]},{"type":"code","value":"append: (chunks) => Promise<TOffset[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts#L17","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts:17"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Persist a batch before it is delivered and return exactly one resumable\noffset for each chunk, in the same order."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"chunks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"chunks"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md